# This repo dogfoods monitor on itself (installed via install-monitor.sh .).
# The installed engine copy under .claude/ is project-local, not portable
# source (plugins/monitor/ is the actual source, unaffected since these
# paths are root-anchored) — monitor/, the generated data folder, is
# committed like any consumer project's.
/.claude/skills/monitor/
/.claude/commands/monitor/

# Isolated agent worktrees (spawned with isolation: worktree) live here —
# local scratch state, never portable source.
/.claude/worktrees/
